---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Logo from '../assets/logo.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Rian O'Leary is a first-year Immersive Software Engineering student at UL who builds tools, is learning Java, and runs this site as a DevOps project."
	pubDate={new Date('October 07 2026')}
>
	{/* Not the layout's heroImage: that slot is sized for wide 2:1 photos, and a square logo
	    there renders around 1000px tall. */}
	<Image src={Logo} alt="99rebels logo" width={200} class="logo" />

	<p>
		Hi, I'm Rian. I'm a first-year student on the Immersive Software Engineering (ISE) course at
		the University of Limerick, and I'm currently learning to program in Java.
	</p>

	<p>
		This site is my project for CS4421, a DevOps module. The posts matter less than how the site
		gets built and shipped: every change starts as a ticket, goes through a branch, a reviewed pull
		request and automated checks, and is then deployed to AWS.
	</p>

	<p>I love solving problems, and making money from them is a bonus. A few things I've built:</p>

	<ul>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/99rebels/total-recall">Total Recall</a> — a study tool built on
			active recall. You enter your notes and questions, and it brings them back after a day, a
			week, a month and three months so they stick in long-term memory.
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/99rebels/headless-crm-skill">Headless CRM</a> — a CRM with no
			interface of its own, driven by an AI agent instead.
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/99rebels/web-accessibility-audit">Web Accessibility Audit</a> — a
			WCAG 2.1 AA audit with 20+ automated checks that produces client-ready reports, fix code
			snippets and a remediation roadmap.
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/99rebels/aeo-toolkit">AEO Toolkit</a> — checks how visible a
			website is to AI agents, from JavaScript rendering gaps to blocked AI crawlers, and generates
			the files needed to fix it.
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/99rebels/webclient-studio">WebClient Studio</a> — an AI agent
			skill bundle for freelance web designers: qualify leads, build proposals, onboard clients and
			track the pipeline.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<p>There's more on <a href="https://github.com/99rebels">my GitHub</a>.</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.logo {
		display: block;
		margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg);
	}
</style>
